<div class="page-header"><h1>导入 <small>---过渡期 Excel 双轨（模板 = 月度工作簿对应表）</small></h1></div>

<% if @check_token %>
  <div class="alert alert-warning d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
    <span>已生成标注文件：在表格末列逐行给出错误/警告。全部清除「错误」后才能导入（警告不阻断，导入后请复核）。</span>
    <%= link_to "下载标注文件", import_check_file_path(token: @check_token),
                class: "btn btn-sm btn-warning", data: { turbo: false } %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%# 核对导出（phase3 3.1）：系统 ↔ Excel 核对工作簿（指纹四表），单月或跨月区间 %>
<div class="card mb-3">
  <div class="card-header"><h5>核对工作流（导出 → Excel 编辑 → 核对导入）</h5></div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <%= form_tag check_export_imports_path, method: :get, class: "row g-2 align-items-end" do %>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <label class="form-label small mb-0">起始月（YYYY-MM）</label>
        <input type="text" name="from" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="2025-12" required>
      </div>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <label class="form-label small mb-0">截止月（可缺省 = 起始月，整月对齐）</label>
        <input type="text" name="to" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="2026-05">
      </div>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <%= submit_tag "① 下载核对工作簿", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary", data: { turbo: false } %>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 small text-muted">
        四张核对表带隐藏指纹列（行ID/更新时间）与模板版本；销售订单核对仅含已提交（草稿不核对）；
        未交订单为截至截止月末的快照（未来出库不计入）。
      </div>
    <% end %>
    <hr class="my-2">
    <%= form_tag upload_check_imports_path, multipart: true, class: "row g-2 align-items-end" do %>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <label class="form-label small mb-0">② 上传核对工作簿（差异预览，不落库）</label>
        <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
      </div>
      <div class="col-auto">
        <%= submit_tag "生成差异预览", class: "btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" %>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 small text-muted">
        预览列出 新增/修改/作废/冲突 清单，确认后才应用；同一文件只能应用一次（sha256 防重）。
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入客户订单</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_customer_orders_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「客户订单」表）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            自然键 = 订单号 + 型号 + 版本；重复导入只更新，不产生重复数据。<br>
            型号 = SCT+4位数字+XY[+Z]（第 10 位为后缀 C/M/S，可缺省）；位次或后缀不符报错；未建档报错。<br>
            冲销：同一订单号下数量填负数（或类型/特殊要求标注"冲销"），自动生成冲销单「订单号-Rn」，受可冲销余额限制。
          </div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入报价</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_prices_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「价格」表）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">自然键 = Price_number；客户不存在的行报错阻断。</div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入生产订单（六联单）</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_sales_orders_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「生产订单-六联单」表，含订单N/分配量N）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            自然键 = 六联单号；导入即已提交（Excel 为准，D14）；分配对直接生成台账。<br>
            分配对「订单N」可写 订单号-行号（AB2026-003-1）或纯订单号（AB2026-003，唯一行自动对应）；「产品」列 = 完整型号；前置：客户订单须先导入。
          </div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入出库单</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_shipments_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「出库单」表：日期/客户/六联单号/产品/数量/快递号）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">
            同（六联单号+日期+快递号）的行合成一张出库单；幂等键 = 六联单号+日期+快递号，重复导入整单重建（Excel 为准）。<br>
            金额列导入忽略（系统按报价成分自动计算）；前置：六联单须先导入。
          </div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入客户</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_customers_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「客户」表：英文名/中文名/区域/币别/付款方式…）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">自然键 = 英文名；已存在则更新资料；中文名唯一；公司全称/销售类型/币别必填。客户订单导入的前置。</div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="col-md-6">
    <div class="card mb-3">
      <div class="card-header"><h5>导入产品</h5></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <%= form_tag import_items_imports_path, multipart: true do %>
          <div class="mb-2">
            <label class="form-label small mb-0">工作簿（「产品」表：型号/产品名称/类别/…）</label>
            <input type="file" name="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" accept=".xlsx" required>
          </div>
          <div class="small text-muted mb-2">产品列表只维护通用型号；型号同文件唯一；产品名称/描述/类别必填。客户订单导入的前置。</div>
          <button type="submit" name="commit" value="check" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">检查</button>
          <%= submit_tag "导入", class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h4>导入批次</h4>
<table class="table table-striped table-sm datatable">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>时间</th><th>类型</th><th>文件</th><th>操作人</th><th>统计</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <% @imports.each do |imp| %>
      <tr>
        <td><%= imp.created_at.strftime("%F %H:%M") %></td>
        <td><%= { "customer_orders" => "客户订单", "sales_orders" => "六联单", "prices" => "报价",
                   "shipments" => "出库单", "customers" => "客户", "items" => "产品" }[imp.kind] || imp.kind %></td>
        <td><%= imp.filename %></td>
        <td><%= imp.imported_by&.name %></td>
        <td class="small">
          新建 <%= imp.stats["created"] %> / 更新 <%= imp.stats["updated"] %> / 跳过 <%= imp.stats["skipped"] %>
          <% (imp.stats["errors"] || []).each do |w| %>
            <div class="text-danger">✘ <%= w %></div>
          <% end %>
          <% (imp.stats["warnings"] || []).each do |w| %>
            <div class="text-warning-emphasis">⚠ <%= w %></div>
          <% end %>
        </td>
      </tr>
    <% end %>
  </tbody>
</table>
